// expect: refuse E_InstantiationDepth
// The show sibling of mn-instantiation-depth-eq: past the cap the base
// renders the growing structure as the word it is, so boot dbbfd107 printed
// an address where ten nested lists belonged. Refused at the ninth level's
// call (R0″, 2026-09-28).
fn deep(x, n) = if n == 0 { "{x}" } else { deep([x], n - 1) }

fn main() = byte_len(deep(7, 10))
